@startuml
!include theme.puml
title Browser session | Observable state and retry policy
[*] --> Loading : App mounts
state "loading" as Loading
state "unauthenticated" as Guest
state "authenticated\nprincipal in React context" as Auth
state "request refresh in flight\nAuthContext may remain authenticated" as Refresh
Loading --> Auth : Refresh succeeds + GET /me succeeds
Loading --> Guest : Refresh or principal restoration fails
Guest --> Auth : Login succeeds + GET /me
Guest --> Guest : Invalid form / credentials\nshow inline error
Auth --> Refresh : Protected request returns 401
Refresh --> Auth : Refresh succeeds; original request\nretried once and no longer 401
Refresh --> Guest : Refresh fails OR retry is 401\nsession-expired handler
Auth --> Guest : Logout promise resolves
note right of Loading
Loading route: accessible status spinner.
Guest protected route: redirect /login,
remember original pathname.
Successful login navigates back.
end note
note right of Refresh
One module-level Promise deduplicates
refresh within one browser JS runtime.
No shared multi-tab coordination.
No scheduled proactive expiry timer.
end note
note bottom of Auth
Access JWT is not in localStorage/sessionStorage.
HttpOnly refresh cookie survives reload for restoration.
Query cache is separate and not cleared by auth transitions.
Logout network-error path requires further UX verification.
end note
@enduml
